0,Southern Quechua - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Southern_Quechua,"Quechuan. Quechua II.Santiagueño Quechua in Argentina is divergent, and appears to derive from a mix of dialects, including South Bolivian.[4] The Argentinian dialects of Catamarca and La Rioja are extinct.[5].","Quechua, Arequipa-La Unión",Quechuan
1,"Quechua, Arequipa-La Union language. Evangelism tools, church...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/qxu,"Audio recordings available in Quechua, Arequipa-La Union. These recordings are designed for evangelism and basic Bible teaching to bring the gospel message to people who are not literate or are from oral cultures, particularly unreached people groups.","Quechua, Arequipa-La Unión",Quechuan
